#
# Fields: id, gene, rsid, chrom, pos, effect (allele[s] counted), name (short label)
#   section: where a carrier shows up ('health', 'traits'); non-carriers of 'screen' markers go to "Checked and fine"
#   fine:  line for "Checked and fine" when the person carries 0 copies (screened markers only)
#   texts: {copies: item}  item = level/title/finding/what/size/todo/note (plain language, absolute numbers)
#   check: optional doctor-checklist rows for carriers [(test, why, how often)]

